From the mod-host PR prepared at https://github.com/linuxnow/mod-host/tree/hardening (d01be5c):
both ports listen on 127.0.0.1 unless -b says otherwise; a second daemon on a busy port is refused
(SO_REUSEADDR, not SO_REUSEPORT); a plugin state path stays inside its instance directory.

